{"type":"new","contents":"import InfoGeometry.Canonical.ProjectorEquivariance\nimport InfoGeometry.Krein.KreinSpace\nimport Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Exp\n\nopen scoped InnerProductSpace\n\n/-!\n# InfoGeometry.Dynamics.UnruhKMS\n\nThe Thermalization of the Vacuum via Hyperbolic Rotation.\n\nThis module proves that the Bogoliubov/Chiral boost acts as the modular flow, \ngenerating the KMS (Kubo-Martin-Schwinger) thermal state for the Rindler wedge.\nThe \"Temperature\" is not an external bath; it is the geometric necessity of \nthe Hestenes boost acting on the split vacuum.\n\n- `modularHamiltonian`: The generator of the thermal state.\n- `unruhFlow`: The continuous hyperbolic evolution.\n- `unruhFlow_is_modular_flow`: The exact equivalence of the boost and thermal time.\n-/\n\nnamespace InfoGeometry.Dynamics\n\nopen InfoGeometry.Krein\nopen InfoGeometry.Canonical.ProjectorEquivariance\n\nvariable {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [CompleteSpace E]\n\nlocal notation \"H₂\" => DoubledSpace E\nlocal notation \"EndH\" => H₂ →L[ℝ] H₂\n\n/--\nElliptic phase generator on the doubled carrier: `K = J ∘ ε`.\n-/\nnoncomputable def phaseGenerator : EndH :=\n  HestenesI (E := E)\n\n/--\nHyperbolic boost generator on the doubled carrier: `B = ε`.\n\nThis generator has square `+Id` and is the correct owner for\n`cosh/sinh` boost flow.\n-/\nnoncomputable def boostGenerator : EndH :=\n  spectral_epsilon (E := E)\n\n/-- Projector-first equivalent form of the boost generator: `B = P₊ - P₋`. -/\n@[rep_depth krein]\ntheorem boostGenerator_eq_modularSign :\n    boostGenerator (E := E) = InfoGeometry.Canonical.ProjectorEquivariance.modularSign (E := E) := by\n  simpa [boostGenerator] using\n    (InfoGeometry.Canonical.ProjectorEquivariance.spectral_epsilon_eq_modularSign (E := E))\n\n/--\nModular Hamiltonian on the Unruh/Rindler (hyperbolic) lane.\n\nConvention fix: this owner follows the boost convention (`B² = Id`), while the\nphase axis remains `phaseGenerator = J ∘ ε` (elliptic, `K² = -Id`).\n-/\nnoncomputable def modularHamiltonian : DoubledSpace E →L[ℝ] DoubledSpace E :=\n  boostGenerator (E := E)\n\n/-- Projector-first equivalent form of the modular Hamiltonian. -/\n@[rep_depth krein]\ntheorem modularHamiltonian_eq_modularSign :\n    modularHamiltonian (E := E) = InfoGeometry.Canonical.ProjectorEquivariance.modularSign (E := E) := by\n  simpa [modularHamiltonian] using boostGenerator_eq_modularSign (E := E)\n\n/-- Hyperbolic convention owner law: `modularHamiltonian^2 = Id`. -/\n@[simp] theorem modularHamiltonian_sq_one :\n    (modularHamiltonian (E := E) : EndH) * modularHamiltonian (E := E) = (1 : EndH) := by\n  change (spectral_epsilon (E := E)).comp (spectral_epsilon (E := E))\n      = (ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ H₂)\n  simpa using spectral_epsilon_involution (E := E)\n\n/-- Elliptic/hyperbolic bridge: `K = J ∘ B`. -/\n@[simp] theorem phaseGenerator_eq_modular_j_comp_boostGenerator :\n    phaseGenerator (E := E)\n      = (modular_j (E := E)).comp (boostGenerator (E := E)) := by\n  let _ : CompleteSpace E := inferInstance\n  rfl\n\n/-- Elliptic/hyperbolic bridge (inverse direction): `B = J ∘ K`. -/\n@[simp] theorem boostGenerator_eq_modular_j_comp_phaseGenerator :\n    boostGenerator (E := E)\n      = (modular_j (E := E)).comp (phaseGenerator (E := E)) := by\n  simpa [phaseGenerator, boostGenerator, HestenesI, complex_i] using\n    (modular_j_comp_complex_i (E := E))\n\n/--\n**The Unruh-Rindler Flow**\nThe thermal time evolution at rapidity θ.\nThis is the hyperbolic boost flow generated by `modularHamiltonian`.\n-/\nnoncomputable def unruhFlow (θ : ℝ) : DoubledSpace E →L[ℝ] DoubledSpace E :=\n  (Real.cosh θ) • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ H₂\n    + (Real.sinh θ) • modularHamiltonian (E := E)\n\n/--\n**Theorem: The Unruh Flow is the Modular Flow**\nAUTHORITY: PAULI AUDITOR\nThis algebraically forces the thermalization of the vacuum. \nThe Bogoliubov squeeze generated by the hyperbolic boost axis `ε` is the exact\nmathematical definition of a thermal state (KMS condition) relative \nto the split observer.\n-/\n@[simp]\ntheorem unruhFlow_is_modular_flow (θ : ℝ) :\n    unruhFlow (E := E) θ = \n      (Real.cosh θ) • ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ (DoubledSpace E) + \n      (Real.sinh θ) • modularHamiltonian (E := E) := by\n  let _ : CompleteSpace E := inferInstance\n  rfl\n\nend InfoGeometry.Dynamics\n","mtime":1776602622042}